  "body": "The generic part of this repo's agentic workflow (lessons, orchestration, review rounds, issue/lot loop, labels, release tags) was extracted into `francoisgn/agentic-harness` so every project of the maintainer shares one versioned framework.\n\n## Scope\n- Vendor the framework at 0.1.0 into `.harness/` with `scripts/harness-sync.sh` (English blocks, `.harness/config.json`).\n- Keep everything project-specific: AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md rules win, `docs/agents/LESSONS.md` stays the reference, own issue forms, PR template, lot template, label taxonomy.\n- Excluded: framework issue forms, PR template, lot template, markdownlint config, labels seed, `feedback-triage` skill, `harness*` workflows (a private framework's reusable workflows cannot be called from `ezzz`, and `issues` events only run from `master`).\n- Adds: 5 skills under `.claude/skills/`, `guard-git` + session-start hooks in `.claude/settings.json`.\n\n## Updates\n`/harness-update` skill or `harness-sync.sh --ref vX.Y.Z --target .`, in a draft PR.",
